+["quest","170","details","I hope you're here to lend us a hand, warrior. After the last trogg attack, we could use all the help we can get.\n\nI hear the buggers have been popping up all across the lands, and it seems Coldridge Valley is no exception. They've been spotted all over the hills to the southeast and near the frozen lake.\n\nAnd that's not all, just a few nights ago, they attacked and overran our camp to the west! \n\nWe're a bit shorthanded here, lad, and we need strong arms to help drive the troggs back.","70003",["a1d23cdd"]],
+["quest","170","ender","npc:713","70003",["6c0292aa"]],
+["quest","170","giver","npc:713","70003",["cf0cdec7"]],
+["quest","170","objectives","Balir Frosthammer wants you to kill 6 Rockjaw Troggs and 6 Burly Rockjaw Troggs.","70003",["819b96d9"]],
+["quest","170","reward","If the problems we've had here are indicative of what is happening elsewhere in our lands, by Magni's beard, we have some troubles ahead of us! I can only hope that the king and Senate are taking steps to deal with the threat the troggs pose.","70003",["e99457f1"]],
+["quest","170","title","A New Threat","70003",["8d6fc583"]],
+["quest","170","where","[1426,29.8,71.3]","70003",["5a25bab4"]],
+["quest","179","details","What do we have here? You look as though you might need something to keep your hands warm, hm?\n\nI'll tell you what would help: a pair of nice, warm gloves. And, being the kind soul that I am, I'd be more than happy to provide you with a suitable pair. I've one condition, however.\n\nI need you to go get me some wolf meat. Nice arrangement, hm? You bring me some wolf meat, and I'll make sure you don't lose any digits to frostbite. Well, what do you say?","70003",["eadd9cf3"]],
+["quest","179","ender","npc:658","70003",["9de05506"]],
+["quest","179","giver","npc:658","70003",["ecca565c"]],
+["quest","179","objectives","Sten Stoutarm would like 8 pieces of Tough Wolf Meat.","70003",["11d1ec8c"]],
+["quest","179","request","Wolves giving you a bit of trouble? You'd do well to avoid the fangs and claws and other sharp bits, yes?","70003",["9314933a"]],
+["quest","179","reward","Ah! Wonderful. The wolf meat should do nicely. Oh, don't worry, $N, I wouldn't forget my part of the bargain. Here, one of these should fit you.","70003",["b485dd88"]],
+["quest","179","title","Dwarven Outfitters","70003",["96a72d68"]],
+["quest","179","where","[1426,29.9,71.3]","70003",["35ff7441"]],
+["quest","182","details","My brother Senir and I were sent to different parts of Dun Morogh to investigate the threat posed by the trolls. The Senate has its hands full with the troggs, so they've no need for further annoyances.\n\nFrom what I've seen, the trolls aren't well situated here in Coldridge Valley--mostly the southern cave. I'd say that the army will not be necessary. A few strong arms should be more than enough.\n\nPerhaps you'd like to assist in this endeavor? I have the authority to offer compensation for your help.","70003",["c35b71d3"]],
+["quest","182","giver","npc:786","70003",["51bd4d1d"]],
+["quest","182","objectives","Grelin Whitebeard would like you to kill 14 Frostmane Troll Whelps.","70003",["fc5afd1b"]],
+["quest","182","title","The Troll Cave","70003",["ca62571d"]],
+["quest","182","where","[1426,25,75.7]","70003",["3dcbd6e7"]],
+["quest","183","details","Nothing like a day of boar hunting, eh?\n\nThough, here in Coldridge Valley, there are so many boars it almost takes the fun out of it. No need to get them charging. They're all angry and ready without any help. In fact, recently, there've been so many boars in the area, it's become dangerous for me to do my daily hunting.\n\nLong story short, if you could help me kill some of the boars, I would appreciate it.","70003",["24ae1aa7"]],
+["quest","183","ender","npc:714","70003",["3fbe790f"]],
+["quest","183","giver","npc:714","70003",["dd9a488d"]],
+["quest","183","objectives","Talin Keeneye would like you to kill 12 Small Crag Boars.","70003",["6d2dca4d"]],
+["quest","183","reward","Excellent! I can go back to my... leisurely... hunting now. Thank you, $N.","70003",["2fe698ad"]],
+["quest","183","title","The Boar Hunter","70003",["4801ae90"]],
+["quest","183","where","[1426,22.6,71.3]","70003",["801f6f00"]],
+["quest","233","details","Hm, I don't suppose you'd be willing to do a favor for me, lad? A stack of letters came through the pass today, but I don't have the time to send them along.\n\nThey're all addressed to Talin Keeneye. You can find him to the west down the road. He's set up camp next to the frozen lake.\n\nWhat do you say?","70003",["d80bda14"]],
+["quest","233","ender","npc:714","70003",["4f03f2ae"]],
+["quest","233","giver","npc:658","70003",["db038b39"]],
+["quest","233","objectives","Deliver the stack of letters to Talin Keeneye.","70003",["aa4816d9"]],
+["quest","233","request","Yes? Do you have something for me?","70003",["d1d8bfbe"]],
+["quest","233","reward","Thank you, I've been waiting for these letters for quite some time...\n\nUnfortunately, these letters aren't all for me. This one is addressed to Grelin Whitebeard. He's not too far away if you'd like to deliver it to him.","70003",["dde3170c"]],
+["quest","233","title","Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery","70003",["88dc907e"]],
+["quest","233","where","[1426,29.9,71.3]","70003",["b1fbb0db"]],
+["quest","234","details","If I remember correctly, Grelin's camp is down the road to the southeast. No doubt he'll be eager to get his mail.","70003",["835f054c"]],
+["quest","234","ender","npc:786","70003",["9915770c"]],
+["quest","234","giver","npc:714","70003",["775ba919"]],
+["quest","234","objectives","Deliver the letter to Grelin Whitebeard.","70003",["ca3b6a2d"]],
+["quest","234","request","Is there something I can help you with?","70003",["e3aa1fe3"]],
+["quest","234","reward","Ahh, excellent. It's been a while since I received word from Ironforge.","70003",["82d90f6a"]],
+["quest","234","title","Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery","70003",["ab6f4ad2"]],
+["quest","234","where","[1426,22.6,71.3]","70003",["ef7b383e"]],
@@ -445,0 +691,7 @@
+["quest","806","details","We cannot allow the Burning Blade a foothold in Durotar!  We must destroy them before their evil festers!\n\nI have undergone my own investigations and found that a Burning Blade warlock, the goblin Fizzle Darkstorm, has camped within Thunder Ridge to the northwest.  There he and his cultist minions spread chaos.\n\nFind and defeat Fizzle, and bring me his dead claw!","70576",["d13c7b8b"]],
